cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "DMPBridge: structured extraction of Data Management Plans with local LLMs"
abstract: >-
  DMPBridge turns Data Management Plan PDFs into structured, machine-readable
  records using a locally hosted LLM. It reads a PDF, classifies each block of
  text as a title, section heading, section description, question or answer,
  and outputs JSON in the DMP Tool schema. Nothing leaves the machine it runs
  on.
type: software
authors:
